## CONTEXT OPTIMIZATION RULES

### Token efficiency
- Never include entire files unless explicitly requested
- Reference specific functions/classes with @symbols, not whole modules
- Use @Codebase only as last resort
- Prefer @folder for scoped context over full project

### History management
- Summarize long discussions before continuing
- Start new chat when topic changes completely
- Keep conversations under 20 exchanges when possible

### Response constraints
- Provide minimal working examples, not full rewrites
- Show only changed code sections with context lines
- No explanatory essays unless asked for